/issues/481\",\n \"number\": 481,\n \"state\": \"open\",\n \"locked\": false,\n \"title\": \"feat(QPBT/Combining): prove the concrete subline real-part bound\",\n \"user\": {\n  \"login\": \"Dengnifer\",\n  \"id\": 89234078,\n  \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MjM0MDc4\",\n  \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89234078?v=4\",\n  \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n  \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer\",\n  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/Dengnifer\",\n  \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/followers\",\n  \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/following{/other_user}\",\n  \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/gists{/gist_id}\",\n  \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n  \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/subscriptions\",\n  \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/orgs\",\n  \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/repos\",\n  \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/events{/privacy}\",\n  \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/received_events\",\n  \"type\": \"User\",\n  \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n  \"site_admin\": false\n },\n \"body\": \"### Motivation\\n- Close #480's concrete Claim 17-2 calculation while accurately distinguishing the proved real-part estimates on the directly indexed subline law from the source complex estimates. The source is `references/qpbt-paper/14_analysis_of_the_pauli_basis_test.tex`, Claims 17-1 through 17-3 and the combined-point lemma.\\n\\n### Description\\n- Prove the concrete X-Z-X scalar estimate from its exact X marginal, expanded line-point consistency, the separate X mixture, and projective Cauchy-Schwarz. Preserve all three scalar theorem signatures and proof bodies.\\n- Give each proved scalar estimate a separate auxiliary blueprint entry with its actual distribution, completed evaluations, real-part conclusion, and measurement hypotheses. Keep source-distribution transport, complex comparisons, and concrete paired-line consistency explicitly open.\\n- Document the completed point constructor through field-valued commutation, a Z-X-Z sandwich POVM, orthonormalization on the original spaces, and triangle inequalities. Retain the source's binary-refinement route and its ancilla obligation separately.\\n- Replace the unused duplicate placement module with an import of the canonical implementation so both paths can coexist. Correct the prefix, Parseval-column, fiber, and Z-only module descriptions.\\n\\n### Testing\\n- Focused Claims, Points, and PlacementSupport build passed; both placement import orders elaborate. C1/C2/C3, the point/subline constructors, and placed measurements use only `propext`, `Classical.choice`, and `Quot.sound`. Concrete paired-line consistency retains its recorded `sorryAx`.\\n- Existing-parser comparison confirms every non-comment token of Claims.lean is unchanged. Source-header checks, blueprint rendering/synchronization, all 1661 declaration links, global completion-marker axiom checks, LaTeX and gap-note checks passed. The gap note compiles to PDF.\\n- Normal hooks and checked publication remain enabled. A fresh independent review must exclude all 16 prior corrected-request authors plus repair author `01a082a2-e8d7-7ab3-a512-e4afeec3b820`; the earlier 12-author requests provide no evidence. Exact-head CI and review remain required.\\n\\n---\\nCloses #480\\n\",\n \"created_at\": \"2026-09-08T22:00:00Z\",\n \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-09T08:23:29Z\",\n \"closed_at\": null,\n \"merged_at\": null,\n \"merge_commit_sha\": null,\n \"assignees\": [],\n \"requested_reviewers\": [],\n \"requested_teams\": [],\n \"labels\": [\n  {\n   \"id\": 12025012384,\n   \"node_id\": \"LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8goA\",\n   \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/proof\",\n   \"name\": \"proof\",\n   \"color\": \"ededed