M0MDc4\",\n  \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89234078?v=4\",\n  \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n  \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer\",\n  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/Dengnifer\",\n  \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/followers\",\n  \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/following{/other_user}\",\n  \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/gists{/gist_id}\",\n  \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n  \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/subscriptions\",\n  \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/orgs\",\n  \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/repos\",\n  \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/events{/privacy}\",\n  \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/received_events\",\n  \"type\": \"User\",\n  \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n  \"site_admin\": false\n },\n \"body\": \"### Motivation\\n- Restore the original product line-point consistency defect from the conditioned\\n  law used before the pasting step in `lem:qld-xz-lines` (#490), at\\n  `references/qpbt-paper/14_analysis_of_the_pauli_basis_test.tex:950-963`.\\n- Retain the exact discarded probability mass without assuming its subsequent\\n  numerical estimate or claiming the full pasting theorem.\\n\\n### Description\\n- Specialize finite-conditioning restoration to `nondegenerateLinePastingDist`\\n  using `Distribution.avgOver_map`. The bound retains both the retained-mass\\n  multiplier and the discarded zero-direction mass; `Combining.Lines`\\n  re-exports the leaf theorem.\\n- Preserve the stacked restricted-mixture and nonnegative-average results,\\n  opposite-register consistency positivity, and the restricted line-consistency\\n  bound with universal constant `C = 4`. The factors `2m` and `4m^2` correspond\\n  to the source passage at lines 1038-1061. Retain the existing reuse of placement,\\n  operator-product, and product-average lemmas.\\n- Refresh from main while preserving both merge parents and every staged input.\\n  The three conflicts in `Points/Consistency.lean` retain the explicit\\n  `DistanceCalculus.applyOperatorToState_mul` qualification and the incoming\\n  paper-gap citation. Public assumptions and conclusions are unchanged.\\n- Stack base: `issue-464-consistency-discarded-mass` (PR #467). Issue #490\\n  remains blocked by open prerequisites #464 (PR #467) and #455 (PR #460);\\n  both native dependency edges are retained.\\n\\n### Testing\\n- Focused Lean checks for `Points/Consistency.lean` and the pasting-restoration\\n  leaf, plus the `Combining.Points` and `Combining.Lines` module build.\\n- Canonical pending-merge loss guard; all 3365 original stage-zero entries\\n  verified unchanged before the incident-log append.\\n- No proof holes or bypasses in the resolved file or restoration leaf;\\n  the three existing `Lines.lean` proof holes remain.\\n- Full `lake build` passed (9182 jobs) through canonical `warm-worktree.sh`\\n  under the machine-wide build lock. All 616 pre-commit tests and integrity\\n  audits passed; the canonical committed-merge loss guard also passed.\\n- Validation subprocesses clear inherited `MIPSTARRE_JOB_CLASS` and\\n  `MIPSTARRE_HARDNESS_REASON` so routing fixtures use their own inputs.\\n- `checked-push.sh` passed every changed-file Lean check, integrity audit,\\n  and declaration-sync check (all 1415 blueprint declarations resolved).\\n  GitHub confirms refreshed head `5ff7dc43c9549f189a6e3cac96a6e215d30c01cc`.\\n- Canonical `ci.sh 491` passed all eight gates; all nine `local-ci/*`\\n  statuses are success on the refreshed head. Independent review belongs to\\n  main; the prior head's approval is not claimed for this refresh.\\n- The separate `blueprint_leanok_axioms.py --ci` audit passed: no proof-level\\n  `\\\\leanok` declaration depends on `sorryAx`. Statement-level warnings and\\n  advisory duplicate-helper reports remain existing proof-status limitations.\\n\\n---\\nCloses #490\\n\",\n \"created_at\": \"2026-09-09T00:24:09Z\",\n \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-09T12:15:01Z\",\n \"closed_at\": null,\n \"merged_at\": null,\n \"merge_commit_sha\": \"e1d2c343441462fce403ffd4fa082925c0a04e3b\",\n \"assignees\": [],\n \"requested_reviewers\": [],\n \"requested_teams\": [],\n \"labels\": [\n  {\n   \"id\": 12025010884,\n   \"node_id\": \"LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA\",\n   \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization\",\n   \"name\": \"formalization\",\n   \"color\": \"ededed\",\n   \"default\": false,\n   \"description\": \"Lean formalization of a mathematical statement\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": 12025015304,\n   \"node_id\": \"LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8sCA\",\n   \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/auto-fix-codex\",\n   \"name\": \"auto-fix-codex\",\n   \"color\": \"ededed\",\n   \"default\": false,\n   \"description\": \"Automation-managed queue for codex auto-fix follow-ups\"\n  }\n ],\n \"milestone\": null,\n \"draft\": false,\n \"commits_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/491/commits\",\n \"review_comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/491/comments\",\n \"review_comment_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/comments{/number}\",\n \"comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/491/comments\",\n \"statuses_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/statuses/5ff7dc43c9549f189a6e3cac96a6e215d30c01cc\",\n \"head\": {\n  \"label\": \"Dengnifer:issue-490-pasting-restoration\",\n  \"ref\": \"issue-490-pasting-restoration\",\n  \"sha\": \"5ff7dc43c9549f189a6e3cac96a6e215d30c01cc\",\n  \"user\": {\n   \"login\": \"Dengnifer\",\n   \"id\": 89234078,\n   \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MjM0MDc4\",\n   \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.git