or collision assumption.\\n\\n### Description\\n- Add `nondegenerateLinePastingDist_collision_bound` in the dedicated\\n  `Lines/ConditionalCollision.lean` leaf.\\n- Derive each conditioned fiber estimate from the product weighted-collision\\n  bound and positive retained mass.\\n- Re-export the leaf from `MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.Lines`.\\n\\n### Testing\\n- `lake build MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.Lines.ConditionalCollision`\\n- `lake env lean MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/Lines/ConditionalCollision.lean`\\n- `lake build MIPStarRE.QPBT.Combining.Lines`\\n- Axiom audit: `propext`, `Classical.choice`, and `Quot.sound` only.\\n- `scripts/install_git_hooks.sh --check`\\n- `git diff --check`\\n\\n---\\nCloses #489\\n\",\n \"created_at\": \"2026-09-09T00:50:47Z\",\n \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-09T11:41:41Z\",\n \"closed_at\": null,\n \"merged_at\": null,\n \"merge_commit_sha\": null,\n \"assignees\": [],\n \"requested_reviewers\": [],\n \"requested_teams\": [],\n \"labels\": [\n  {\n   \"id\": 12025012384,\n   \"node_id\": \"LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8goA\",\n   \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/proof\",\n   \"name\": \"proof\",\n   \"color\": \"ededed\",\n   \"default\": false,\n   \"description\": \"Issue is primarily about proving an existing result\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": 12025015304,\n   \"node_id\": \"LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8sCA\",\n   \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/auto-fix-codex\",\n   \"name\": \"auto-fix-codex\",\n   \"color\": \"ededed\",\n   \"default\": false,\n   \"description\": \"Automation-managed queue for codex auto-fix follow-ups\"\n  }\n ],\n \"milestone\": null,\n \"draft\": false,\n \"commits_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/492/commits\",\n \"review_comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/492/comments\",\n \"review_comment_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/comments{/number}\",\n \"comments_url