": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89234078?v=4\",\n  \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n  \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer\",\n  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/Dengnifer\",\n  \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/followers\",\n  \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/following{/other_user}\",\n  \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/gists{/gist_id}\",\n  \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n  \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/subscriptions\",\n  \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/orgs\",\n  \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/repos\",\n  \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/events{/privacy}\",\n  \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/Dengnifer/received_events\",\n  \"type\": \"User\",\n  \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n  \"site_admin\": false\n },\n \"body\": \"### Motivation\\n\\n- Complete the existing full expanded-line packet #116 on current public\\n  interfaces, preserving PR213's original published and local proof history.\\n- The source is `lem:qld-comm-line-cons`,\\n  `references/qpbt-paper/14_analysis_of_the_pauli_basis_test.tex:523-678`;\\n  blueprint nodes `def:expanded-line-measurement` and `lem:qld-comm-line-cons`.\\n\\n### Description\\n\\n- Recover the complete facade and module chain: polynomial restriction,\\n  ancillary projectors, convolution measurement, self-consistency, exact\\n  line-point overlap, bipartite transport, evaluation-class consistency, and\\n  selected-point consistency. This is the full packet, not a reduced subset.\\n- Preserve all 21 existing public headers and the full\\n  `ExpandedLineConclusions` definition. All eight original targets and\\n  `exists_deltaLine` are proved without extra assumptions or proof holes.\\n- Handle all four directed opposite-placement pairs and the existing completed\\n  evaluation classes, retaining the universal constants and common square-root\\n  error. The formal proof obtains linear estimates from exact overlaps and\\n  projective refinement before applying the common square-root bound.\\n- Retain the exact published #297 Restriction implementation and the repaired\\n  #115/PR207 interfaces. Replace obsolete helper names and duplicate private\\n  proofs with their current public counterparts; do not import the honest\\n  strategy merely for shared lemmas.\\n- Preserve both original PR213 heads through a normal two-parent history merge.\\n  The original local head `f1dc470` remains in the preserved ancestry.\\n  The 2026-09-09 repair reconciles the pending historical-worktree main merge\\n  with published head `b04ced12` through normal two-parent merges; both issue116\\n  checkouts now retain the complete published proof content at `ebba143d`. No reset,\\n  forced update, worktree deletion, or replacement PR is used.\\n- Document source provenance, current API adaptations, statement integrity,\\n  and historical resolution in `audits/2026-09-07-expanded-line-recovery.md`.\\n  The blueprint retains the correct summed-overlap argument instead of the\\n  archived fixed-outcome equality. Historical owner-session rows and the\\n  clock-supersession evidence remain preserved without duplicate charges.\\n- The #297 prerequisite/child remains a normal integration gate. No B8 attempt\\n  or cumulative-budget reset is part of this recovery.\\n\\n### Testing\\n\\n- Direct Lean checks of every recovered implementation module and the public\\n  `LineMeasurement.lean` facade.\\n- Scoped Lake builds through `MIPStarRE.QPBT.Observables.LineMeasurement`.\\n- Fresh axiom checks of all eight packet targets plus `exists_deltaLine`:\\n  only `propext`, `Classical.choice`, and `Quot.sound`. Twelve additional\\n  construction/error-helper closures are likewise standard-only.\\n- Original existential statement checked explicitly; source-header guard\\n  passes and `ExpandedLineConclusions` is byte-identical to the existing form.\\n- Aggregate `lake env lean MIPStarRE/QPBT.lean` passes.\\n- Blueprint web rendering and synchronization pass (1,421 declarations).\\n- Normal source-preservation and merge-loss guards pass, including the\\n  historical merge across three best merge bases. Source and index hashes were\\n  unchanged by the approved branch renames.\\n- Canonical exact-head CI, independent review, and service-owned merge remain\\n  separate required gates; these author checks do not replace them.\\n\\n---\\nCloses #116\\n\",\n \"created_at\": \"2026-09-05T01:42:25Z\",\n \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-09T13:58:10Z\",\n \"closed_at\": null,\n \"merged_at\": null,\n \"merge_commit_sha\": \"4e456a587a9df5f6f130c2f5f4c51061602cabe1\",\n \"assignees\": [],\n \"requested_reviewers\": [],\n \"requested_teams\": [],\n \"labels\": [\n  {\n   \"id\": 12025010884,\n   \"node_id\": \"LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA\",\n   \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization\",\n   \"name\": \"formalization\",\n   \"color\": \"ededed\",\n   \"default\": false,\n   \"description\": \"Lean formalization of a mathematical statement\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": 12025015304,\n   \"node_id\": \"LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8sCA\",\n   \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/auto-fix-codex\",\n   \"name\": \"auto-fix-codex\",\n   \"color\": \"ededed\",\n   \"default\": false,\n   \"description\": \"Automation-managed queue for codex auto-fix follow-ups\"\n  }\n ],\n \"milestone\": null,\n \"draft\": false,\n \"commits_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/213/commits\",\n \"review_comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/213/comments\",\n \"review_comment_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/comments{/number}\",\n \"comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/